---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section id="features" class="py-12 md:py-section border-b border-outline">
  <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 flex flex-col gap-6 md:gap-12">
    <div class="max-w-2xl flex flex-col gap-2">
      <h2 class="font-headline text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg text-on-surface text-balance">
        Engineered for Maximum Bandwidth &amp; Zero Bloat
      </h2>
      <p class="font-body text-body-md text-on-surface-variant text-pretty">
        Every core IDM workflow rebuilt natively with GTK4, Libadwaita, SQLite persistence, and direct positional disk writes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div id="how-it-works" class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 items-stretch">
      <!-- Card 1 (Large, 2-col): Dynamic Multi-Part Segmentation -->
      <article class="lg:col-span-2 bg-surface-container border border-outline rounded-md p-6 flex flex-col justify-between gap-6 h-full">
        <header class="flex flex-col gap-1">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-adwaita-blue mb-1">
            <Icon name="split" size={18} />
            <span class="font-label text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider">Core Engine</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-title text-title-lg text-on-surface">Dynamic Multi-Part Segmentation</h3>
          <p class="font-body text-body-md text-on-surface-variant text-pretty">
            When a fast worker finishes early, TurboDM automatically bisects the slowest active byte range in half to eliminate tail slowdown — backed by 1 MB write buffers and atomic <code class="font-mono text-mono-md text-on-surface">os.pwrite</code>.
          </p>
        </header>

        <div class="bg-surface-dim border border-outline-subtle rounded-lg p-4 flex flex-col gap-2">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="font-mono text-mono-sm text-on-surface-variant">Worker #01 (Finished)</span>
            <span class="font-mono text-mono-sm text-emerald-green">100% → Reassigned</span>
          </div>
          <div class="h-2.5 w-full bg-emerald-green rounded-xs"></div>

          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-1">
            <span class="font-mono text-mono-sm text-on-surface-variant">Worker #08 (Slowest Range Split 50/50)</span>
            <span class="font-mono text-mono-sm text-cyan-tip">2x Parallel Finish</span>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-1.5">
            <div class="h-2.5 bg-adwaita-blue rounded-xs flex justify-end overflow-hidden"><div class="w-1.5 bg-cyan-tip"></div></div>
            <div class="h-2.5 bg-emerald-green rounded-xs flex justify-end overflow-hidden"><div class="w-1.5 bg-cyan-tip"></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Card 2 (1-col): Rock-Solid Pause & Resume -->
      <article class="lg:col-span-1 bg-surface-container border border-outline rounded-md p-6 flex flex-col justify-between gap-6 h-full">
        <header class="flex flex-col gap-1">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-emerald-green mb-1">
            <Icon name="database" size={18} />
            <span class="font-label text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider">Crash-Safe</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-title text-title-md text-on-surface">Rock-Solid Pause &amp; Resume</h3>
          <p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant text-pretty">
            SQLite WAL byte-offset persistence + ETag validation across restarts &amp; disconnects.
          </p>
        </header>

        <div class="bg-surface-dim border border-outline-subtle rounded-lg p-4 flex flex-col gap-1.5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="font-mono text-mono-sm text-on-surface-variant">ETag</span>
            <span class="font-mono text-mono-sm text-emerald-green">"a4f9-9b201"</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="font-mono text-mono-sm text-on-surface-variant">Offset</span>
            <span class="font-mono text-mono-sm text-on-surface tabular-nums">1,976,442,880 B</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Card 3 (1-col): YouTube & HLS Video Grabber -->
      <article class="lg:col-span-1 bg-surface-container border border-outline rounded-md p-6 flex flex-col justify-between gap-6 h-full">
        <header class="flex flex-col gap-1">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-adwaita-blue mb-1">
            <Icon name="video" size={18} />
            <span class="font-label text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider">Media</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-title text-title-md text-on-surface">YouTube &amp; HLS Video Grabber</h3>
          <p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant text-pretty">
            Powered by yt-dlp + ffmpeg with 4K/1080p/MP3 quality selector and 10 MB chunk anti-throttling.
          </p>
        </header>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-primary-container text-on-primary-container font-mono text-mono-sm">4K MKV</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-surface-dim border border-outline text-on-surface font-mono text-mono-sm">1080p MP4</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-surface-dim border border-outline text-on-surface-variant font-mono text-mono-sm">MP3 / M4A</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Card 4 (1-col): IDM Categories & Auto-Routing -->
      <article class="lg:col-span-1 bg-surface-container border border-outline rounded-md p-6 flex flex-col justify-between gap-6 h-full">
        <header class="flex flex-col gap-1">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-adwaita-blue mb-1">
            <Icon name="tree" size={18} />
            <span class="font-label text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider">Organization</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-title text-title-md text-on-surface">IDM Categories &amp; Auto-Routing</h3>
          <p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant text-pretty">
            Automatic extension sorting directly into clean XDG folders with UTF-8 / Arabic filename support.
          </p>
        </header>

        <div class="bg-surface-dim border border-outline-subtle rounded-lg p-4 font-mono text-mono-sm text-on-surface-variant flex flex-col gap-1">
          <span class="text-on-surface">~/Downloads/</span>
          <span class="pl-3">├─ Compressed/</span>
          <span class="pl-3">├─ Documents/</span>
          <span class="pl-3">├─ Music/</span>
          <span class="pl-3">├─ Programs/</span>
          <span class="pl-3 text-adwaita-blue">└─ Video/</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Card 5 (1-col): Batch Wildcards & Scheduler -->
      <article class="lg:col-span-1 bg-surface-container border border-outline rounded-md p-6 flex flex-col justify-between gap-6 h-full">
        <header class="flex flex-col gap-1">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-warning mb-1">
            <Icon name="clock" size={18} />
            <span class="font-label text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider">Automation</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-title text-title-md text-on-surface">Batch Wildcards &amp; Scheduler</h3>
          <p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant text-pretty">
            Queue numbered series with a single pattern and schedule off-peak transfers with post-queue actions.
          </p>
        </header>

        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <div class="px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded bg-surface-dim border border-outline">
            <code class="font-mono text-mono-sm text-adwaita-blue">ep[01-12].mp4</code>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded bg-surface-dim border border-outline">
            <span class="font-mono text-mono-sm text-on-surface-variant tabular-nums">02:00 – 06:00</span>
            <span class="w-7 h-4 rounded-full bg-emerald-green/25 border border-emerald-green flex items-center justify-end p-0.5" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-green"></span>
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Card 6 (Large, 2-col): Background GNOME Integration -->
      <article class="lg:col-span-2 bg-surface-container border border-outline rounded-md p-6 flex flex-col justify-between gap-6 h-full">
        <header class="flex flex-col gap-1">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-emerald-green mb-1">
            <Icon name="bell" size={18} />
            <span class="font-label text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider">Wayland Desktop</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-title text-title-lg text-on-surface">Background GNOME Integration</h3>
          <p class="font-body text-body-md text-on-surface-variant text-pretty">
            Closing the main window keeps TurboDM alive quietly in the background with native GNOME desktop notifications and live global or per-file bandwidth throttling.
          </p>
        </header>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-12 gap-4 items-center">
          <div class="sm:col-span-8 bg-surface-dim border border-outline rounded-md p-4 flex flex-col gap-2">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <Icon name="checkCircle" size={17} class="text-emerald-green" />
                <span class="font-label text-label-lg text-on-surface">Download Complete</span>
              </div>
              <span class="font-mono text-mono-sm text-on-surface-variant">now</span>
            </div>
            <p class="font-mono text-mono-sm text-on-surface-variant">Fedora-Workstation-45.iso (2.41 GB)</p>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 pt-1">
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-surface-container-high border border-outline font-label text-label-sm text-on-surface">Open File</span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-surface-container-high border border-outline font-label text-label-sm text-on-surface">Open Folder</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="sm:col-span-4 bg-surface-dim border border-outline rounded-md p-4 flex flex-col gap-1">
            <span class="font-label text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">Speed Limiter</span>
            <span class="font-mono text-mono-lg text-amber-warning tabular-nums">12.0 MB/s</span>
            <span class="font-mono text-mono-sm text-on-surface-variant">Cap Active</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
